senses.gloss:
शम्पा f. (-म्पा) Lightning.
 E. शम् happiness, पा to drink, क and टाप् affs.;
destroying pleasure by its awful appearance.

समुद्रचुलुक m. (-कः) The saint AGASTYA.
 E. समुद्र the sea, चुलुक a pot;
having drank up the ocean.

समुद्राम्बरा f. (-रा) The earth.
 E. समुद्र the sea, and अम्बर vesture;
clothed or invested by the ocean.
